item.scroll_ender.desc=Fires an ender-colored magic bolt; on impact, teleports you to the hit position and deals 5 fall damage.
item.scroll_life_drain.name=Life Drain Scroll
item.scroll_life_drain.desc=Creates a life-drain orb above your head for 10 seconds; other creatures within 5 blocks lose 4 health per second and you heal 2 health per second.
item.scroll_sky_strike.name=Super-Tier Magic - Sky Strike
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc=A super-tier spell sealed in a blank scroll. Right-click to fire a fast magic projectile.
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc.1=On hitting a block, an entity, or after 96 blocks, multiple heavenly arrays unfold at the impact point.
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc.2=The main array has a 48-block radius and sits at the world ceiling at the top of the beam; destruction and damage are limited to a 16-block diameter. After charging, a 16-block-diameter beam descends all the way to the bedrock layer and the final attack lasts 30 seconds.
item.scroll_sky_strike.desc.3=Each second, creatures in range lose 1/5 of their max health directly and take 300 armor-piercing absolute magic damage. Blocks with hardness -1 survive.
item.scroll_magic_cannon.name=Magic - Magic Cannon
item.scroll_magic_cannon.desc=Hold the blank scroll to charge; arrays appear in front of the caster and under their feet, then fire a magic cannon after about 3 seconds.
item.scroll_magic_cannon.desc.1=The beam has a 2-block radius and a maximum length of 128 blocks, and destroys blocks with blast resistance below 20.
item.scroll_magic_cannon.desc.2=The beam lasts 5 seconds; creatures in range take 30 armor-piercing absolute magic damage every second.

